        {
          "say": "Total is 578 kilojoules. Fat gives almost 40 percent.",
          "write": "total ≈ 5.8 × 10² kJ"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Respiration versus combustion",
      "lines": [
        {
          "say": "Burning glucose and respiration have the same overall equation.",
          "write": "C₆H₁₂O₆ + 6O₂ → 6CO₂ + 6H₂O"
        },
        {
          "say": "So delta H is the same, about minus 2800 kilojoules per mole.",
          "write": "ΔH ≈ −2.8 × 10³ kJ mol⁻¹"
        },
        {
          "say": "Combustion releases it all at once, as heat and light.",
          "write": "one burst",
